	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element homepage-campus-header h2" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h2 class="homepage-campus-header h2">Discover <abbr title="University of Hawaii">UH</abbr> Mānoa</h2>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1665523301923"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p class="lead">Founded in 1907, the University of <span aria-label="Hawaii">Hawaiʻi</span> at Mānoa is a destination of choice for students and faculty from across the nation and the world. <abbr title="University of Hawaii">UH</abbr> Mānoa offers unique research opportunities, a diverse community, a nationally-ranked Division I athletics program and much more.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1665523349485 vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-flex"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><div class="vcex-module vcex-teaser vcex-teaser-three wpex-flex wpex-flex-col wpex-surface-2"><div class="vcex-teaser-media textcenter"><a href="https://manoa.hawaii.edu/research/" class="wpex-no-underline"><img width="600" height="350" src="https://manoa.hawaii.edu/wp/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/news-kilo-moana-300.jpg" class="wpex-align-middle" alt="UH marine researchers deploying water sampling system" loading="lazy" decoding="async" srcset="https://manoa.hawaii.edu/wp/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/news-kilo-moana-300.jpg 600w, https://manoa.hawaii.edu/wp/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/news-kilo-moana-300-300x175.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" /></a></div><div class="vcex-teaser-content wpex-p-20"><h3 class="vcex-teaser-heading wpex-heading wpex-text-lg"><a href="https://manoa.hawaii.edu/research/" class="wpex-no-underline">World-Class Research</a></h3><div class="vcex-teaser-text wpex-mt-10 wpex-last-mb-0 wpex-clr"><p><abbr title="University of Hawaii">UH</abbr> Mānoa is one of a handful land-, sea- and space-grant institutions. It is a global leader in earth and environmental sciences consistently ranked among the top 15 universities internationally.</p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><div class="vcex-module vcex-teaser vcex-teaser-three wpex-flex wpex-flex-col wpex-surface-2"><div class="vcex-teaser-media textcenter stretch-image"><a href="https://hawaiiathletics.com/" class="wpex-no-underline"><img width="350" height="204" src="https://manoa.hawaii.edu/wp/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/tc-ching-field.jpg" class="wpex-align-middle" alt="View of TC Ching field - the temporary home of UH football - from the stands" loading="lazy" decoding="async" srcset="https://manoa.hawaii.edu/wp/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/tc-ching-field.jpg 350w, https://manoa.hawaii.edu/wp/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/tc-ching-field-300x175.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px" /></a></div><div class="vcex-teaser-content wpex-p-20"><h3 class="vcex-teaser-heading wpex-heading wpex-text-lg"><a href="https://hawaiiathletics.com/" class="wpex-no-underline">Athletics</a></h3><div class="vcex-teaser-text wpex-mt-10 wpex-last-mb-0 wpex-clr"><p>Athletics has a storied history at <abbr title="University of Hawaii">UH</abbr> Mānoa stretching back more than a century. Cheer on the Rainbow Warrior and Rainbow Wahine teams as they continue their winning tradition.</p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><div class="vcex-module vcex-teaser vcex-teaser-three wpex-flex wpex-flex-col wpex-surface-2"><div class="vcex-teaser-media textcenter stretch-image"><a href="https://manoa.hawaii.edu/campus-life/diversity/" class="wpex-no-underline"><img width="350" height="204" src="https://manoa.hawaii.edu/wp/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/multicultural-students-sm.jpg" class="wpex-align-middle" alt="Students representing the UH Manoa campus&#039; rich ethnic diversity" loading="lazy" decoding="async" srcset="https://manoa.hawaii.edu/wp/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/multicultural-students-sm.jpg 350w, https://manoa.hawaii.edu/wp/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/multicultural-students-sm-300x175.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px" /></a></div><div class="vcex-teaser-content wpex-p-20"><h3 class="vcex-teaser-heading wpex-heading wpex-text-lg"><a href="https://manoa.hawaii.edu/campus-life/diversity/" class="wpex-no-underline">A Multicultural Experience</a></h3><div class="vcex-teaser-text wpex-mt-10 wpex-last-mb-0 wpex-clr"><p><abbr title="University of Hawaii">UH</abbr> Mānoa delivers a multicultural global experience in a Hawaiian place of learning, with a long history of adherence to the principles of sustainability and the essence of aloha.</p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
</div></div>

